obs query: good/observability/obs.yaml: versions match the evaluators embedded in this obs; thresholds applied: logs, metrics, traces, profiles
note : [vl-settings] no good/observability/victorialogs-settings.yaml; using obs.yaml thresholds.logs over VictoriaLogs v1.54.0 query defaults (extract deployed chart args to this file or use --vl-settings)
note alerts/charge-errors/critical.yaml rule charge-errors-critical query A: [names] reads metrics=[checkout_charges_total] labels=[outcome]
note alerts/charge-errors/critical.yaml rule charge-errors-critical query A: [threshold-removed] ran the query without its 1 comparison(s) or absence check(s): a threshold filters rows out on a quiet seed; query run: sum(rate(checkout_charges_total{outcome="error"}[5m]))
note alerts/error-logs/warning.yaml rule error-logs-warning query A: [event-rule] events=[checkout.charge.failed]
note alerts/error-logs/warning.yaml rule error-logs-warning query A: [assumed-filter] assumed true (free-form fields): severity_text:ERROR
note alerts/error-logs/warning.yaml rule error-logs-warning query A: [names] reads filter fields=[_stream _stream:durian.cloud.service _time durian.cloud/event severity_text] pipe fields=[] wildcard=false stats labels=[]
note alerts/error-logs/warning.yaml rule error-logs-warning query A: [assumed-filter] assumed true (free-form fields): severity_text:ERROR
note alerts/failed-logs/warning.yaml rule failed-logs-warning query A: [event-rule] events=[checkout.charge.failed]
note alerts/failed-logs/warning.yaml rule failed-logs-warning query A: [names] reads filter fields=[_stream _stream:durian.cloud.service _time durian.cloud/event] pipe fields=[payment.provider] wildcard=false stats labels=[payment.provider]
note alerts/latency/critical.yaml rule latency-critical query A: [names] reads metrics=[http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket] labels=[http.route le]
note alerts/latency/critical.yaml rule latency-critical query A: [threshold-removed] ran the query without its 1 comparison(s) or absence check(s): a threshold filters rows out on a quiet seed; query run: histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{http.route="/charge"}[5m])) by(le))
note dashboards/overview.json panel 1 "Charges by outcome" target A: [names] reads metrics=[checkout_charges_total] labels=[outcome payment.provider]
note dashboards/overview.json panel 2 "p95 latency" target A: [names] reads metrics=[http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket] labels=[http.route le]
note dashboards/overview.json panel 4 "Failed charges" target A: [names] reads filter fields=[durian.cloud/event payment.provider] pipe fields=[] wildcard=true stats labels=[]
